From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:36:58 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 05/10] iommu: qcom-hyp-smmu: match qcom,sm8350-smmu-500

The SM8350 apps SMMU has no qcom,smmu-500 fallback compatible, so every
device behind it failed to find its IOMMU (-ENODEV) and never probed.

Signed-off-by: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
---
 drivers/iommu/qcom-hyp-smmu.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/iommu/qcom-hyp-smmu.c b/drivers/iommu/qcom-hyp-smmu.c
index 5b37c21f..bafc34fc 100644
--- a/drivers/iommu/qcom-hyp-smmu.c
+++ b/drivers/iommu/qcom-hyp-smmu.c
@@ -392,6 +392,7 @@ static const struct udevice_id qcom_smmu500_ids[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sc7280-smmu-500" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sdm845-smmu-500" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm6350-smmu-500" },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8350-smmu-500" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,smmu-500", },
 	{ /* sentinel */ }
 };
-- 
2.56.0

